{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_7B3B48E1","title":"Nixxi at The Spire","entry":"Dlg_7B3B48E1::entry","exit":"Dlg_7B3B48E1::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_0D2B0389","articyId":"72057774426557492","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Look at us. Who would have guessed we'd make it all the way here.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look at us. Who would have guessed we'd make it all the way here.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":576.0,"y":408.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47888","byteOffset":32452360,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_077D74EE","articyId":"72057774426557511","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"The Spire! And what a perfect place for my penultimate stream.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The Spire! And what a perfect place for my penultimate stream.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1176.0,"y":408.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24252","byteOffset":17051112,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_00983697","articyId":"72057774426557524","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Retiring. Soon, I get to live my life based on my own choices instead of what my audience votes for me to do. Which is less fun... obviously.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Retiring. Soon, I get to live my life based on my own choices instead of what my audience votes for me to do. Which is less fun... obviously.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1776.0,"y":408.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21834","byteOffset":16149312,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_919026F3","articyId":"72057774426557543","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"It's a commercial break right now so I can be honest cos I'm offline. It's the right time for a move. I just need to complete one last task, but I'm not sure my audience will go for it.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's a commercial break right now so I can be honest cos I'm offline. It's the right time for a move. I just need to complete one last task, but I'm not sure my audience will go for it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2376.0,"y":408.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25890","byteOffset":17677360,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_AFC0C6AD","articyId":"72057774426557562","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"The audience will spend all their channel points and their vote is the one I have to go with.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The audience will spend all their channel points and their vote is the one I have to go with.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3575.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36393","byteOffset":28113088,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_DD20C169","articyId":"72057774426557588","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"They get to decide what I do when I quit streaming. They have three options: delivery driver, exile to the Ventz, or retirement in luxury here, in the Spire.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"They get to decide what I do when I quit streaming. They have three options: delivery driver, exile to the Ventz, or retirement in luxury here, in the Spire.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2976.0,"y":408.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21594","byteOffset":16058144,"byteLength":576}},{"id":"DFr_BD6AAB43","articyId":"72057783016488976","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Because their channel points make up my salary. If all of them chip in, they can pay for my life here. But if they decide it's funnier to send me to the Ventz, their channel points will pay for a relocation company to send me there.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Because their channel points make up my salary. If all of them chip in, they can pay for my life here. But if they decide it's funnier to send me to the Ventz, their channel points will pay for a relocation company to send me there.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4175.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52347","byteOffset":34217968,"byteLength":576}},{"id":"DFr_4A3643F7","articyId":"72057783016488989","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"It's fifty-fifty. I like those odds.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's fifty-fifty. I like those odds.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4775.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30240","byteOffset":19320640,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_C82AF25F","articyId":"72057783016489008","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"They'll either send me to the Ventz or keep me here in the Spire. No one wants to watch me work for a delivery company.","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"They'll either send me to the Ventz or keep me here in the Spire. No one wants to watch me work for a delivery company.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5375.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17489","byteOffset":14503704,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_CE4B3A17","articyId":"72057783016489044","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nixxy","text":"Not exactly. I won't stream anymore, but I'll be featured in a follow up Nets series about my life in luxury. Or poverty. So wish me luck!","speakerId":"Ntt_1DBCCD4D","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not exactly. I won't stream anymore, but I'll be featured in a follow up Nets series about my life in luxury. Or poverty. So wish me luck!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5975.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18375","byteOffset":14839792,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_4F859DA3","articyId":"72057774426557499","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Not me.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not me.","TextSheVersion":"Not me.","TextTheyVersion":"Not me."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":876.0,"y":308.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42787","byteOffset":30516112,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_10EE6D66","articyId":"72057774426557505","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Me.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Me.","TextSheVersion":"Me.","TextTheyVersion":"Me."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":876.0,"y":533.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29841","byteOffset":19170776,"byteLength":284}},{"id":"DFr_C303B8B9","articyId":"72057774426557518","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You're quitting?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You're quitting?","TextSheVersion":"You're quitting?","TextTheyVersion":"You're quitting?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1476.0,"y":408.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48924","byteOffset":32849480,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_FCDC2C6A","articyId":"72057774426557531","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"The Spire is pretty luxurious.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The Spire is pretty luxurious.","TextSheVersion":"The Spire is pretty luxurious.","TextTheyVersion":"The Spire is pretty luxurious."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3276.0,"y":533.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26070","byteOffset":17743928,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_6D711CFC","articyId":"72057774426557537","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You'll be losing out on a lot of money.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You'll be losing out on a lot of money.","TextSheVersion":"You'll be losing out on a lot of money.","TextTheyVersion":"You'll be losing out on a lot of money."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2075.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50452","byteOffset":33429208,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_9B1BC766","articyId":"72057774426557550","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragm